 * @param array &$array <p>
 * Note that prefix is only required if
 * extract_type is EXTR_PREFIX_SAME,
 * EXTR_PREFIX_ALL, EXTR_PREFIX_INVALID
 * or EXTR_PREFIX_IF_EXISTS. If
